Vita: compile out the mods gfx service. It hands mods the WebGPU device, passes and
present targets (wgpu C API); the Vita renders with GXM and links no WebGPU. Mods that
import the service fail with upstream's own "missing service" message. src/dusk/mods/svc/gfx.cpp
is left out of the Vita build (cmake/VitaApp.cmake). Not game code.

--- a/src/dusk/mods/svc/registry.cpp
+++ b/src/dusk/mods/svc/registry.cpp
@@ -281,7 +281,10 @@
             &svc::g_gameModule,
             &svc::g_cameraModule,
             &svc::g_windowModule,
+#if !TARGET_VITA
+            // Exposes the WebGPU device and render passes; the Vita renders with GXM.
             &svc::g_gfxModule,
+#endif
             &svc::g_audioResModule,
             &svc::g_saveModule,
             &svc::g_stageModule,
